  "replacement_segments": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "text": "莉娜裹紧了红色的毛呢外套，在那棵大树前轻轻停下了脚步。她推开那一层薄薄的树皮，发现树干内部竟然盘旋着一道向下的木质阶梯。在最高的那一级台阶上，坐着一只穿着补丁绿马甲的老灰狐狸，他正用那双深邃的眼睛注视着来访者。"
    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s1"
}

{
  "bridge_text": "The shadows cast by the hollow tree certainly make Mosk act quite stern, but perhaps there is more to his prickly heart than meets the eye. As Lina stands on that top step, she decides to see if a small kindness can soften his mood.",
